# ANDP credential/state files (2026-07-28). `meeshy.sh release --andp` writes
# the FULL App Store Connect .p8 private key into .andp/secrets.yml, and the
# CI steps write secrets.yml the same way — neither path was covered by the
# `*.p8` rule above, so a later `git add` would have committed the key.
# Motifs NON ancrés : ANDP résout $ANDP_CONFIG_DIR/ → ./.andp/ → ~/.andp/, et
# le cwd varie selon le job (racine du repo en CI, apps/ios en local). Ancrer
# sur apps/ios/ laissait un .andp/ de racine traçable — donc committable.
.andp/
secrets.yml
apps/ios/andp.yml

apps/ios/SourcePackages/
.superpowers/
tasks/screenshots/

